  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "c01",
      "stage": "ideas",
      "title": "Campaign 01 · Introduction",
      "angle": "Who House of Navi is, and the first project we walk with.",
      "page": "carousel-01.html",
      "date": "",
      "notes": "",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY_HERO IMAGE.jpg",
          "kicker": "A spotlight · not a solution",
          "headline": "Stories can change the world.",
          "body": ""
        },
        {
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-terracotta.png",
          "kicker": "Who we are",
          "headline": "A small house for big stories.",
          "body": "House of Navi is a South African non-profit. We shine a light on initiatives already creating change — and connect them to the people who want to carry them further."
        },
        {
          "layout": "logo",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-knuckles.jpg",
          "kicker": "",
          "headline": "We are",
          "body": "We strive to help stories travel beyond where they are rooted, reaching those willing to be part of whatever extraordinary things come next.\n\nHouse of Navi brings local communities, filmmakers, organisations and advocates together, using creativity and collaboration to express the initiatives already making a resonant impact."
        },
        {
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-14.jpg",
          "kicker": "№ 01 · Healthcare",
          "headline": "Mkasanga Community Clinic",
          "body": "Six to eight hours from the nearest hospital. Cut off entirely during the rains. Already half-built by the people who need it."
        },
        {
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-26.jpg",
          "kicker": "Get involved",
          "headline": "Walk with us.",
          "body": "Support a project, partner with us, or simply pass the story on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c02",
      "stage": "ideas",
      "title": "Campaign 02 · The Name",
      "angle": "What \"Navi\" means: the word, its three roots, and three dictionary entries.",
      "page": "carousel-02.html",
      "date": "",
      "notes": "",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "body": "Ours carries three.",
          "headline": "Every name carries a story.",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-footsteps-sand.png",
          "kicker": "A name is a promise"
        },
        {
          "body": "Three languages, one quiet instruction — speak for those who go unheard.",
          "headline": "Navi",
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-32.jpg",
          "kicker": "The word"
        },
        {
          "body": "House of Navi is, at heart, a storytelling organisation. The ambition isn't to give people a voice: the communities we work with already have one. It is to create the platform, storytelling and reach that let those voices, ideas and initiatives travel further.",
          "closing": "",
          "gloss": "One who speaks, communicates or carries a message.",
          "headline": "Voice",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-knuckles.jpg",
          "kicker": "noun · from the Hebrew נָבִיא",
          "layout": "definition",
          "sense": 1
        },
        {
          "body": "House of Navi isn't the protagonist. It is the bridge between:\n- local initiatives ↔ global audiences\n- stories ↔ action\n- awareness ↔ funding\n- creatives ↔ changemakers\n- communities ↔ partners\n- people ↔ the natural world",
          "closing": "",
          "gloss": "To find the way between; to help the right people find one another.",
          "headline": "Navigation",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-knuckles.jpg",
          "kicker": "verb · as in navigate",
          "layout": "definition",
          "sense": 2
        },
        {
          "body": "We don't arrive to create change from scratch. Our role is to amplify effort and bring more people into the story, so it can be completed.",
          "closing": "Hope in action, rather than charity.",
          "gloss": "The next chapter of something already in motion.",
          "headline": "New beginnings",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-knuckles.jpg",
          "kicker": "noun · newness, a beginning",
          "layout": "definition",
          "sense": 3
        },
        {
          "body": "We could have called it Navi Foundation, Navi Initiative or Navi Organisation.\nBut House of Navi says something different.\nA house is a place that holds things.\nIt can hold different people, different stories, different disciplines and different projects without forcing all of them to look the same.\n",
          "headline": "A small house for big stories",
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-12.jpg",
          "kicker": "Why it matters"
        },
        {
          "body": "Brand, film, story — the craft that makes people stop and look. We took those tools off the billboard and pointed them at the work that actually matters.",
          "headline": "We come from the agency world.",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/texture-knuckles.jpg",
          "kicker": "Where we come from"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c03",
      "stage": "ideas",
      "title": "Campaign 03 · Why are we here?",
      "angle": "The problem House of Navi exists to solve, and how we help.",
      "page": "carousel-03.html",
      "date": "",
      "notes": "",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/DRONE MKASANGA.jpg",
          "kicker": "",
          "headline": "Why are we here?",
          "body": ""
        },
        {
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-17.jpg",
          "kicker": "The problem",
          "headline": "People tackling problems bigger than themselves.",
          "body": "With hard work and limited resources, they build solutions for their communities. It's difficult, and it leaves little time to share their stories with the world. Yet in today's digital world, that is essential to gather the support and resources needed to keep making an impact."
        },
        {
          "image": "",
          "kicker": "This is where we come in",
          "headline": "From awareness to change.",
          "body": "We use skills learned in the agency world to support communities and campaigns already creating change. We help turn awareness into change through:\n- Documentary & film\n- Awareness campaigns\n- Community partnerships\n- Fundraising & activation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parked",
      "stage": "ideas",
      "title": "Parked tiles · for a future campaign",
      "angle": "Taken out of Campaign 02, kept to reuse later.",
      "page": "parked.html",
      "date": "",
      "notes": "",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "body": "— what Navi means to us",
          "headline": "A prophet isn't a fortune-teller. It's someone who gives voice to the unseen.",
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY_HERO IMAGE.jpg",
          "kicker": "The one that stuck"
        },
        {
          "body": "Prophet. New. Of the land. Speak — renew — belong.",
          "headline": "Hebrew · Sanskrit · Na'vi",
          "image": "brand/assets/textures/TEXTURE WOOD.png",
          "kicker": "Three roots"
        },
        {
          "body": "Follow the stories, share the work, or help fund the people doing it. Every bit of attention is a spotlight.",
          "headline": "Hold the light with us.",
          "image": "MKASANGA PICS/LION CAMP_MKASAGA VILLAGE_COMMUNITY-24.jpg",
          "kicker": "Walk with us"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
